  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP - Access Coordination and Monitoring Support Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Israeli Cabinet decision, 20 June 2010, to ease restrictions on access of goods and construction materials into the Gaza Strip provides a new window of opportunity to support recovery and reconstruction activities in Gaza. Facilitate access and ensure monitoring of end use of the materials that UNDP require for their projects, and that are categorized by GoI as dual-use/&#x201c;liable to be used for Hamas military purposes&#x201d; (cement, aggregate, steel and piping), and requires approval from Israel.</narrative>
  </description>
